### Goods Receipt API Testing

### Login (Establish Session)
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{TEST_USERNAME}}",
    "password": "{{TEST_USER_PASSWORD}}"
}

###

### List All Goods Receipts
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/goods-receipt
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Create Goods Receipt (Purchase Order)
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/goods-receipt
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "receiptType": "PURCHASE_ORDER",
  "referenceType": "PURCHASE_ORDER",
  "referenceCode": "PO-2026-8989898",
  "warehouseId": 1,
  "locationId": 1,
  "receiptDate": "2026-04-10",
  "expectedDate": "2026-04-10",
  "notes": "Urgent delivery - expedite processing",
  "items": [
    {
      "itemId": 1,
      "uomId": 1,
      "quantityOrdered": 100.00,
      "quantityReceived": 100.00,
      "unitPrice": 10.50,
      "totalPrice": 1050.00,
      "batchNumber": "BATCH-2026-001",
      "expiryDate": "2026-12-31",
      "notes": "Received in good condition"
    }
  ]
}

###

### Create Goods Receipt (Production)
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/goods-receipt
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "receiptType": "PRODUCTION",
  "referenceType": "WORK_ORDER",
  "referenceCode": "WO-2024-001",
  "warehouseId": 1,
  "receiptDate": "2024-01-15",
  "notes": "Production batch #1234",
  "items": [
    {
      "itemId": 3,
      "uomId": 2,
      "quantityOrdered": 200.00,
      "quantityReceived": 200.00,
      "unitPrice": 15.75,
      "totalPrice": 3150.00,
      "batchNumber": "PROD-2024-001"
    }
  ]
}

###

### Create Goods Receipt (Manual)
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/goods-receipt
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "receiptType": "MANUAL",
  "warehouseId": 1,
  "locationId": 2,
  "receiptDate": "2024-01-15",
  "notes": "Manual adjustment - physical count found",
  "items": [
    {
      "itemId": 1,
      "uomId": 1,
      "quantityOrdered": 10.00,
      "quantityReceived": 10.00,
      "notes": "Found during inventory count"
    }
  ]
}

###

### Get Goods Receipt by ID
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/goods-receipt/3
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get Goods Receipt by Number
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/goods-receipt/number/GR26040001
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Update Goods Receipt (Draft Only)
PATCH {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/goods-receipt/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "notes": "Updated notes - additional inspection required",
  "items": [
    {
      "itemId": 1,
      "uomId": 1,
      "quantityOrdered": 100.00,
      "quantityReceived": 95.00,
      "unitPrice": 10.50,
      "totalPrice": 997.50,
      "batchNumber": "BATCH-2024-001",
      "expiryDate": "2024-12-31",
      "notes": "5 units damaged during transit"
    }
  ]
}

###

### Confirm Goods Receipt
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/goods-receipt/3/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "notes": "All items verified and counted. Quality check passed."
}

###

### Cancel Goods Receipt
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/goods-receipt/3/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

###

### List Goods Receipts with Filters
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/goods-receipt?status=DRAFT&receiptType=PURCHASE_ORDER&page=1&limit=10
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Error Scenarios

### Create without required fields
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/goods-receipt
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "receiptType": "PURCHASE_ORDER",
  "notes": "Missing warehouse and items"
}

###

### Confirm non-existent receipt
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/goods-receipt/999/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "notes": "This should fail"
}

###

### Update confirmed receipt (should fail)
PATCH {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/goods-receipt/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "notes": "This should fail if receipt is confirmed"
}

###

### Cancel confirmed receipt (should fail)
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/goods-receipt/3/cancel
Content-Type: application/json
